{"title":"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<p>Three lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/0/390a98e511e94f47fd329ee4b45f700252855007.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l_1, l_2, l_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" /> form an acute-angled triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> in the plane. Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies in the interior of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/9/d694fbb5f4343aa3478faa6f4af36dcca04a72da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tau_{i}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"15\" height=\"13\" /> denote the transformation of the plane such that the image <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/9/dd9b5c0cb50b5159042cfdbfbe1efa704e871aa1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tau_{i} (X)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"46\" height=\"20\" /> of any point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> in the plane is the reflection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/9/74949574eb3bb72bd595192b9685db088e6a44bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"10\" height=\"15\" /> for each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/f/f7fdf52e14b7bec6d3098d2108e3a4deec365250.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i\\in\\{1, 2, 3\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />. Denote by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/a/a2a641c2fc406d7f5345d79d80623592bba6cc00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_{ijk}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"33\" height=\"19\" /> the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/e/96ea5570c307e3e1fb8ec14431dce2e3457c2051.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tau_{k} (\\tau_{j} (\\tau_{i} (P)))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\" /> for each permutation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/7/7e77ac2f68634e9d36db4e965bc2f8d52709c673.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(i, j, k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/f/dcfc6112a596558ea2b5c4d3009f082ec9763d21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,2,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" />. Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/4/fd4e887f1d9eb6cc931de15c168da3f6d5947464.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_{123}, P_{132},P_{213},P_{231},P_{312},P_{321}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"236\" height=\"18\" /> are concyclic if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is the orthocenter of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<p>This page needs a solution! Please help by adding one.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO\" title=\"2026 INMO\">2026 INMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_INMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2026 INMO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indian_National_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Indian National Mathematical Olympiad\"> All INMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017070201\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 120/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 852/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3055/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.766      1 Template:INMO_box\n100.00%    7.766      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36819:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017070201 and revision id 284658. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}